    <h3 id="cdTitle">Start a conversation</h3>
    <p>Email is fastest. Include what you are building, where it hurts, and any deadline that is real. You will hear back from Abdullah directly.</p>
    <dl><dt>Email</dt><dd>abdullah129026@fluxyai.codes</dd><dt>Studio</dt><dd>fluxyai.codes</dd><dt>GitHub</dt><dd>abdullah129026</dd></dl>
    <a class="btn" href="mailto:abdullah129026@fluxyai.codes?subject=Flux%20Studio%20enquiry">Write an email</a>
  </div>
</dialog>

